  "dom.lobby.html.2": "Tap Attack twice to dash. Tap the arena or press WASD to dodge. Watch enemy attack warnings and manage health with life steal, regeneration, or healing companions.",
  "dom.startRun.html.1": "Start game <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>",
