  "dom.wiki_overview.text.1": "Core health rules",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.2": "Manual afterimages",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.3": " use base two ammo, sequentially reloading one every 1,500ms. No HP cost. ",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.4": "New Echo/auto-combo afterimages",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.5": " use one of the same ammo. Existing afterimage dashes are free.",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.6": "Ordinary contact damage is zero",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.7": ". Prepared charges, melee, beams, and bullets deal damage.",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.8": "Life steal starts at 0%",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.9": "; investments heal actual HP damage × life steal. Starting max HP is 200; stage transitions do not heal.",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.10": "④ Attack button: ",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.11": "afterimage launch → dash",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.12": "; arena taps/WASD: ",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.13": "dodge roll",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.14": ".",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.15": "Mobile first",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.16": "Top-down",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.17": "Matter.js physics",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.18": "Random polygon stages",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.19": "Boss barrages",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.20": "Permanent tech tree",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.21": "This wiki describes the prototype's ",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.22": "actual defaults and behavior",
  "dom.wiki_overview.text.23": ". Tech/numeric tables are generated from runtime definitions. This is the running implementation contract, not a final release plan.",
  "dom.wiki_combat.text.1": "Burn damage heals only invested life steal, never at 0%. VFX without simulation results cannot create damage or healing.",
  "dom.wiki_boss.text.1": "Themed bosses choose shared FAN/RADIAL/CHARGE/SUMMON patterns by situation. Summons have count/lifetime limits; return appearances use seeded variants. Extra hit stun and HP-based second phases are outside current scope.",
  "dom.wiki_progression.text.1": "Exact tech properties/prerequisites use the ",
  "dom.wiki_progression.text.2": "complete tech definition table",
  "dom.wiki_progression.text.3": " below. Purchased player state is not its source.",
  "dom.wiki_config.text.1": "Complete hierarchical settings · Searchable",
  "dom.wiki_algorithms.text.1": "Each fixed tick (step):\n 1. Sequential ammo refill with real tick time; gather/consume pending input and ActionState edges\n 2. Stage transitions and dodge refill/decay\n 3. GOLDEN/COYOTE lifetimes and auto-combo planning\n 4. Skip physics during hitstop\n 5. Regeneration and SHADOW bullet-time scale\n 6. Save position/height sweep origins, run companion/enemy AI\n 7. Ability XYZ/arcs, save collision velocities after AI/attack impulses, dash Force, Matter.Engine.update\n 8. beforeSolve vertical sweep→Detector simultaneous XY/Z filter→Pairs/solver→collisionStart/Active damage\n 9. Supplement fast dash/afterimage crossings using the same XY/Z interval\n10. Burn, afterimage acceleration/contact, projectiles; confirm death after same-tick damage/life steal\n11. Complete alignment and create afterimage/recoil at orbit position; attack/recovery/follow-up transitions. One shared ammo per successful manual/Echo/combo creation\n12. RAF draws camera, Renderer2D, and DOM HUD only",
  "dom.wiki_qa.text.1": "Historical v0.8.0–v0.9.0 checks include mocked browser integration and isolated Matter tests. Actual v0.10.1 verification is separate; mocked and real-package integration are not equivalent PASS evidence. This document is a source-derived contract, not a completed-verification or Stable declaration.",
