  "dom.settings.text.4": "Afterimage charge controls ",
  "dom.settings.text.5": "only initial dash impulse and flight acceleration",
  "dom.settings.text.6": ". Damage is ",
  "dom.settings.text.7": "attack power × actual closing speed / reference speed",
  "dom.settings.text.8": ", without charge or distance multipliers. Accurate long dashes can accelerate longer for greater damage. Attack dashes remove lateral velocity at start and do not steer toward enemies. Arena taps/WASD share the same attack-cancelling roll: two charges, sequential500ms refill, first100ms bullet protection. Player contraction ring shows launch preparation; target aim shows remaining-distance timing. Manual afterimages use separate base two ammo, reloading one every1,500ms, with no HP cost. Manual/Echo/combo new afterimages consume one shared ammo; existing dashes are free. Reload is natural, without movement/hit refunds. Ordinary contact deals zero; actual attack damage heals only invested life steal. The old50% break-even assumption is not fixed by the new speed damage formula. Initial values are tunable, not final balance.",
